member.summary:
Ensures that JS functions are serialized with the key '@eval' so they can be appropriately evaluated on the client side. Example:


myFunction: {
    "@eval": "(content) => { return `<div style='display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; text-align: center; height: 100%;'>${content}</div>`; }"
}

Node selection behaviour. Leave unset to disable selection (the default). Set to
 or  to enable it;
listen for changes via the OnSelectionChange event.
